        ],
        [
          "spring-boot-maven-plugin",
          [
            [
              "b"
            ],
            [
              "c"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          " and why it is used?",
          [
            [
              "b"
            ]
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "20924eb1-ed54-8089-8efa-d7a2432e1c7a",
          "type": "text",
          "richText": [
            [
              "It adds Spring Boot features to Maven, like running the app using "
            ],
            [
              "mvn spring-boot:run",
              [
                [
                  "c"
                ]
              ]
            ],
            [
              " and creating self-contained executable jars ("
            ],
            [
              "fat jars",
              [
                [
                  "c"
                ]
              ]
            ],
            [
              ")."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20924eb1-ed54-8049-80a3-c41bea2c47b8",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "richText": [
        [
          "✅ "
        ],
        [
          "How do you build and run a Spring Boot app using Maven or Gradle?",
          [
            [
              "b"
            ]
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "20924eb1-ed54-8016-80f7-f80a466fbf38",
          "type": "text",
          "richText": [
            [
              "Using commands like "
            ],
            [
              "mvn clean install",
              [
                [
                  "c"
                ]
              ]
            ],
            [
              " to build, or "
            ],
            [
              "mvn spring-boot:run",
              [
                [
                  "c"
                ]
              ]
            ],
            [
              " to start the app."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20924eb1-ed54-801f-84ee-d5fdaf4729cb",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "richText": [
        [
          "✅ "
        ],
        [
          "What does the plugin do during the build process?",
          [
            [
              "b"
            ]
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "20924eb1-ed54-80ff-abd5-d463f3d76077",
          "type": "text",
          "richText": [
            [
              "It packages the app into a jar with all dependencies and includes a special main class that starts the Spring Boot app."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20924eb1-ed54-80b2-b63d-def1b5790def",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "richText": [
        [
          "✅ "
        ],
        [
          "Difference between ",
          [
            [
              "b"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "mvn install",
          [
            [
              "b"
            ],
            [
              "c"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          " vs. ",
          [
            [
              "b"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "mvn spring-boot:run",
          [
            [
              "b"
            ],
            [
              "c"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        [
          "?",
          [
            [
              "b"
            ]
          ]
        ]
